  npcName: Urd
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 9106173878621100494, guid: 0fca1092a79a67540b1864b1428874f4,
    type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "You\u2019re breathing heavy\u2026 like you\u2019ve run through sand. That\u2019s
    your <color=orange>stamina draining</color>. If it hits zero, you\u2019ll start
    <color=orange>fading away</color>."
  - You need to <color=orange>eat peaches</color> to recover! Gather apples and peaches
    from your statue pulls, bring them to the <color=orange>Magirissa</color>, and
    she will help you bake a <color=orange>Milopita</color>.
  - "The Milopita will make you <color=orange>move faster</color>. Please\u2026 don\u2019t
    fade."
  - May Fortuna protect you.
  - "Good! Then hurry\u2014take the apples and peaches to the Magirissa's fire. When
    you eat it\u2026 you'll feel your steps lighten, like the wind's at your back."
  typingSpeed: 0.05
